      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.01 (down from ₹0.06 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹14.2m (down 57% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹86.0k (down 89% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.6% (down from 2.4% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 16% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 1% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
